  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I think if VRChat were to seriously consider building a new official hub world and putting serious thought and quality into it, it would greatly enhance engagement. The first two official hubs were incredibly successful and became the hub of activity on the platform. Users met and socialized in the official hubs. It was a key component in the social culture of the platform.\n\nAn official hub has many advantages. It can be showcased and promoted. It can also be kept at a high standard of quality. This gives an official hub great potential to draw in both old and new users.\n\nThere is a great desire for a well-designed hub world. Not just another world on the platform labeled as a hub, but a well-designed hub world to provide a sense of community and a meeting place for all.",
